OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to visit Scotland during
OL,4,ASNP conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is to visit
OL,7,FScotland during the SNP conference.
OL,9,FWhile John Swinney's party assembles in
OL,10,FAberdeen for its annual get-together
OL,11,Flater this week, Burnham will discuss
OL,12,Fhis plans to devolve power to local
OL,13,Fareas during a trip to the central
OL,14,Fbelt.
OL,16,FSwinney is expected to promote his
OL,17,Frenewed push for independence in his
OL,18,Fkeynote conference speech on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
