OL,3,GNEWSABurnham to visit Scotland during
OL,4,ASNP conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the prime minister's first
OL,7,Fsubstantive visit to Scotland since
OL,8,Fmoving into Number 10 - and will be
OL,9,Fviewed by some as evidence that
OL,10,FSwinney's renewed campaign for
OL,11,Findependence has got under the prime
OL,12,Fminister's skin.
